            "review_text": "Wendyt_0303\nHong Kong, China111 contributions\n0\nYummiest Banh Mi\nJun 2026 • Couples\nwent to this hidden gem. was greeted by Aki, the resident pooch. we ordered the Fried Ha Noi Sausage & Pate banh mi. the baguette was the best : crisp & crunchy without killing the roof of your mouth. chatted with Eric and his mom and played with Aki. it’s a cozy and friendly shop. the banh mi was so good we ordered one to go. will definitely visit again next time in Da Nang.\nRead more\nWritten July 7, 2026",
