            "review_text": "Y&SFOOD!\nBangkok, Thailand1110 contributions\n0\nReal Banh Mi!\nJul 2025 • Solo\nDining at GRANDMA VUONG’S - @grandmavuongs - for real and proper Hanoi style Banh Mi. Everything depends on ingredients, specially simple preparations as Banh Mi sandwiches can be: the home-made delicious pate’ and the yummy Vietnamese sausages are the protagonists here. Together with super light and crunchy bread, fresh vegetables and dressing, they transform every single Banh Mi in a blissful pleasure. \nProbably, the best Banh Mi in Da Nang! \n\n⭐️ NEW ENTRY IN THE Y&SFOOD! DA NANG DINING GUIDE 2025.\nRead more\nWritten July 12, 2025",
